            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.20.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li>New: Jira. In Settings → Jira, enter your site, email and an API token
      you create for your own Atlassian account — no admin needed. The Jira
      issues assigned to you that you're working on now (in an open sprint, in
      progress, due soon, or recently updated) appear in Focus with their due
      date and priority. Move one to Done in Jira and it leaves your day.
      Jarvis keeps only each issue's title; the rest is read live.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
